      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "https://testgrid.k8s.io/sig-node-presubmits#pr-kubelet-gce-cluster-e2e-inplace-pod-resize-containerd-main-v2\r\n\r\nWith the migration to podutils and adding some presubmits (from periodic jobs) we are seeing some failures in presubmits. \r\n\r\nThe error seems to have issues finding the right node to create.\r\n\r\n```\r\nERROR: (gcloud.compute.instances.create) Unable to read file [/go/src/github.com/containerd/containerd/test/e2e/master.yaml]: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: '/go/src/github.com/containerd/containerd/test/e2e/master.yaml'\r\nFailed to create master instance due to non-retryable error\r\n...\r\nERROR: (gcloud.compute.ssh) Could not fetch resource:\r\n - The resource 'projects/k8s-jkns-gce-serial-1-4/zones/us-west1-b/instances/e2e-a8ef221c6e-5209e-master' was not found\r\n```",
